          "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_self_supervised_pre_training_transfo",
          "text": "Self-supervised pre-training has transformed vision and language, and researchers naturally reached for the same tools when working with time series. But the fit is awkward.",
