          "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_when_you_randomly_mask_points",
          "text": "When you randomly mask points across a time series, you can shatter the smooth temporal structure that the signal depends on, sometimes making reconstruction so hard the model learns little.",
