          "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_second_introduces_learnable_lineage",
          "text": "Second, it introduces learnable lineage embeddings, a lightweight mechanism that lets one model represent many different past-to-current time distances.",
